# The skill and the docs check out LF on every machine, core.autocrlf or not (deadline retro 2026-10-20,
# item 14). The skill's read budget counts bytes, and a CRLF checkout (or Path.write_text on Windows) adds one
# per line: it once added 677 bytes to GATES.md. text=auto keeps a picture binary.
.claude/skills/** text=auto eol=lf
docs/** text=auto eol=lf
